# A block of the running system failed its seal check (05-medbrains-seal.rules, OS-VERITY.md). On a
# trial start the trial fails; on a proven version in use it is said on every console and the top bar and
# recorded, and acted on at the next start or quiet window. Nothing restarts here.
[Unit]
Description=Record a seal failure of the running system
RequiresMountsFor=/var
After=medbrains-update-reconcile.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/medbrains-os-update seal --running
